{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e9dd81ad1a1a2657","name":"The Worker's Militia","source":{"id":"source:reference-e9dd81ad1a1a2657","title":"The Worker's Militia","revision":24530,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T19:04:04Z","sha256":"00c17d4a9e867f0638c40912e52b2589e23ddc924782daa5b40ae735a1b264c3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24530","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Worker%27s%20Militia&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e9dd81ad1a1a2657","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Worker's Militia starts in the Alagon System, after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Xeran Mining Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Xeran_Mining_Corporation?action=edit&redlink=1"}," lays off its entire staff and brings in a fleet of ",{"tag":"a","children":["HND-9 Mining Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/HND-9_Mining_Droids?action=edit&redlink=1"},". The Xeran executives do not expect the disgruntled workers to resort to sabotage and destruction. A nasty uprising beaks out, and every retaliation raises the stakes. Workers deactivate a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},". Xeran forces the miners out of their corporate housing. The miners reprogram the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," to attack ships leaving the system with ore. Xeran hires bounty hunters to track down the leaders of the militia. Only intervention by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}," restores peace in the Alagon System, and it is an uneasy peace.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
